# Route: guide 42 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to 58, 19
# quests, 0.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Hillsbrad Foothills, Tirisfal Glades, Western Plaguelands, Eastern
# Plaguelands): Darrow Hill -> Southshore -> The Bulwark -> Sorrow Hill ->
# Ruins of Andorhal -> Felstone Field -> Thondroril River -> Ruins of Andorhal
# -> Sorrow Hill -> Quel'Lithien Lodge -> Northpass Tower -> Darrowshire ->
# Corin's Crossing.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Crushridge Warmongers (504;
# Crushridge Warmonger 39-40).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In the Name of the Light (1053), Remember That I Love You
# (92415), Crest of Lordaeron (95189), Bloodied Insignia (95195), Abominable
# Creatures (95250), Barov Family Fortune (5343), Doctor Theolen Krastinov,
# the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper
# (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Dawn's
# Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The Active Agent (5213), The
# Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243), The Archivist (5251),
# Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282), Menethil's Gift (5463),
# Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Dead Man's Plea (8945), Anthion's Old Friend
# (8948).

